 19, marginBottom: 14 }}>Synthetic sample records only. This is a local preview, not an account and not secure medical storage.</Text><Field label="Demo username" value={demoUsername} onChangeText={setDemoUsername} autoCapitalize="none" /><Field label="Demo password" value={demoPassword} onChangeText={setDemoPassword} autoCapitalize="none" /><AppButton title="Sign in to demo" icon="flask-outline" onPress={() => void signInDemo()} /></Card> : null}<Text style={{ color: c.muted, fontSize: 11, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 17 }}>CareVault organises records. It does not diagnose or recommend treatment.</Text></ScrollView></SafeAreaView>;
